{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1582.unity3d","item_key":"commands[9].text","source_sha256":"ed2f89e348f9a0bb089fce2e089edba19703442a9021e5352d5882cdad611bd5","ja":"そっか～♪\nうんうん、気分って、すっごく大事だよね！","zh":"这样啊～♪\n嗯嗯，心情真的很重要呢！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:41:25+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1582.unity3d","item_key":"commands[10].text","source_sha256":"169413cad01366648f2d2f3fd637494c9e1465426d9ba0ce71b27a97565fe5b8","ja":"うん！　だかられいか、いっぱいお話ししよ！\n後は……何をしたらいいのかな？","zh":"嗯！所以丽花，多跟我聊聊天吧！\n之后……要做些什么好呢？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:41:25+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1582.unity3d","item_key":"commands[11].text","source_sha256":"d665c24551b75a90a1fea3d5c983342605483ff5121a19c3b6307c1ad287e5c1","ja":"あ、それなら……\nみんなに、ぎゅーっ！ってするのはどうかな？","zh":"啊，要是那样的话……\n给大家来一个紧紧的抱抱，怎么样呀？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:41:25+00:00"}
