{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1582.unity3d","item_key":"commands[13].text","source_sha256":"e2be93f4dff05a30e9e1194b14b86741eb98f50b1d56e8a841f41be50ed66854","ja":"わぁ……それ、すっごくいいね！\nたまき、みんなにぎゅーっ！しにいくぞ～♪","zh":"哇……那个，真的太棒了！\n环要去找大家抱～抱啦♪","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:41:25+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1582.unity3d","item_key":"commands[20].text","source_sha256":"20cd9b2689188eb2cf7768e93aab14cddad64a5ae3e98f0735f6631ee381f8f2","ja":"あっ。環、麗花さん。\nお疲れさ……。","zh":"啊。环、丽花小姐。\n辛苦……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:41:25+00:00"}
